</div>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">After packing, the items are loaded onto climate‑controlled trucks equipped with GPS tracking.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The loading sequence follows a “reverse‑order” principle—items destined for the farthest corners of the new premises are placed first, while those needed immediately are loaded last.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The drivers follow the pre‑planned route, avoiding low bridges and congested streets, and maintain constant communication with the control center to address any unforeseen delays.</span></li></ul>

<p>At the destination, the uncrating process mirrors the packing plan. The crew unloads the truck, places each box in its designated room according to the inventory code, and begins unpacking.</p>
<p>Fragile items are inspected for damage, furniture is reassembled, and all packaging material is responsibly disposed of or recycled. Finally, a walkthrough with the client confirms that every item has arrived safely and is positioned correctly, completing a seamless move from Tundu to the new location.</p></div>
